  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, expend link depth to deal 2d6 psychic damage to the linked foe per link depth. The size of the die of damage from this feature increases at levels 5 to a d8, at 11 to a d10, and at 17 to a d12. Starting at fifth level, the dice are doubled if pain resonance is used at touch range.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
